From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Feb 2026 18:26:03 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2078/5749] fix(background-agent): handle session.error and
 prevent zombie queue starts

Marks background tasks as error on session.error to release concurrency immediately, and skips/removes error tasks from queues to avoid zombie starts.
